:**enrich_live()**;

fork
  :**KEYLESS baseline — ALWAYS runs**\ncrt.sh (certificate transparency)\nHackerTarget passive DNS · anonymous urlscan\nRDAP · ipwho.is · Shodan InternetDB\nmail / SPF / DMARC · CORS · JARM;
fork again
  if (premium API key present?\nresolve order: ENV var -> skill .env) then (key set)
    :**PREMIUM enrichers**  //(only the keys you actually set)//
