:**ranked pivots + live_results**   (high -> low confidence);

:**correlate — all keyless**
rank_relations.py  score same-operator siblings, drop shared-infra noise
cert_pivot.py / cert_overlap  cert fingerprint + SAN siblings
pivot_suggest.py  ranked next-pivots //(+ ~--cjk: pinyin · Simplified <-> Traditional · company stem)//
wp_impersonate  typosquat / TLD sweep / homoglyph
crypto_balance · email_hygiene · sensitive_paths;

:**reference_check**  — false-positive ledger\n**BENIGN** shared noise  vs  **SIGNAL** operator fingerprint;
note right
  Managed-DNS suffixes, parking favicons and
  CDN ranges are **noise**. A nameserver the
  operator runs themselves is **attribution-grade** —
  you cannot point a domain at ns1.<their-host>
  without controlling that zone.
end note

:save to case store   $INTEL_HOME/cases/<CASE-ID>/raw/<host>.json;
:**kb_ingest**  ->  shared knowledge base (cross-case);
:**graph_build.py**\ncluster hosts into one network graph\nshared favicon / GA / wallet hubs + ranked sibling edges;
:**render_diagram** (IntelGraph)  ·  **render_report** (IntelReport);
stop

